+
+  // Same wall-clock formula `isQuietHoursOk` already proves at the four
+  // boundary instants (`evals/quiet-hours/run.mjs` §1) — reused here rather
+  // than re-typed, since `quietHoursOkForRoomDefaultSql`'s CASE expression is
